{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00383",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.7,
      "end_seconds": 3.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Okay, welcome. Let's see what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 4.33,
      "end_seconds": 8.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.77,
      "end_seconds": 14.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. Lovely day outside, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.35,
      "end_seconds": 19.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "It, It is, I almost forgot I was coming here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.83,
      "end_seconds": 22.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "So, how have things been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.57,
      "end_seconds": 33.76,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "Okay, so I wanted to get pain in my right ear looked at. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.01,
      "end_seconds": 39.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "And when did that start? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.89,
      "end_seconds": 46.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "It's been going on for two days. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.47,
      "end_seconds": 53.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.21,
      "end_seconds": 67.42,
      "duration_seconds": 13.21,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day. I'd give it a eight, uh, out of ten. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.12,
      "end_seconds": 74.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Right, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 74.31,
      "end_seconds": 79.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "So, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.72,
      "end_seconds": 85.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "I was getting to that! I've, I've also had muffled hearing, since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.22,
      "end_seconds": 89.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.67,
      "end_seconds": 96.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.46,
      "end_seconds": 102.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.61,
      "end_seconds": 106.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I'd give it a three, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.07,
      "end_seconds": 113.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Okay. Have you had pain in your right ear before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.88,
      "end_seconds": 118.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last year. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.72,
      "end_seconds": 123.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Any facial weakness, recent swim, dizziness or discharge from the ear at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.76,
      "end_seconds": 136.96,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "No, no facial weakness, no recent swim, no dizziness. I did have a runny nose before it started at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.5,
      "end_seconds": 141.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "And swelling behind the ear, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.73,
      "end_seconds": 146.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "So, no swelling behind the ear, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.3,
      "end_seconds": 149.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.31,
      "end_seconds": 151.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.72,
      "end_seconds": 154.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.43,
      "end_seconds": 157.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.66,
      "end_seconds": 161.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.48,
      "end_seconds": 166.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 167.55,
      "end_seconds": 175.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the clopidogrel was 37.5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.73,
      "end_seconds": 179.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.24,
      "end_seconds": 183.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.52,
      "end_seconds": 187.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.62,
      "end_seconds": 188.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.0,
      "end_seconds": 201.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Right, any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.93,
      "end_seconds": 207.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Yes, I had my appendix out, about eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.93,
      "end_seconds": 213.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "So, do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.01,
      "end_seconds": 216.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.75,
      "end_seconds": 221.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.9,
      "end_seconds": 243.82,
      "duration_seconds": 20.92,
      "text": "I've had asthma, yes. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I've had low haemoglobin for nearly five years now. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I've had an underactive thyroid, yes. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.55,
      "end_seconds": 245.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Mm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.09,
      "end_seconds": 251.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.08,
      "end_seconds": 257.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Okay. Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.64,
      "end_seconds": 264.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "My father had a heart attack. My mother had high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.91,
      "end_seconds": 265.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.68,
      "end_seconds": 270.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.15,
      "end_seconds": 273.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.11,
      "end_seconds": 276.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.89,
      "end_seconds": 280.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.92,
      "end_seconds": 293.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.13,
      "end_seconds": 322.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 100, temperature 39.2, pressure 109 over 69. And respiratory rate 17, saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.84,
      "end_seconds": 325.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.12,
      "end_seconds": 333.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Okay, we'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.12,
      "end_seconds": 337.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.81,
      "end_seconds": 338.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.34,
      "end_seconds": 342.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.94,
      "end_seconds": 356.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "The right eardrum looks red and bulging."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.61,
      "end_seconds": 359.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Right, take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.31,
      "end_seconds": 371.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "The left ear looks normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.58,
      "end_seconds": 393.4,
      "duration_seconds": 18.82,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Putting it all together, it fits best with a middle ear infection. It could also be an outer ear infection, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.0,
      "end_seconds": 397.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I mean, should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.81,
      "end_seconds": 423.11,
      "duration_seconds": 24.3,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a middle ear infection, and we'll watch how it goes. I'll start you on paracetamol, 500 milligrams, every six hours if needed, for three days. That should help with ear pain. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. I'm prescribing azithromycin, 500 milligrams, once a day, for three days. You take it by mouth. It's for ear infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 424.21,
      "end_seconds": 440.37,
      "duration_seconds": 16.16,
      "text": "Keep the ear dry for now and don't put anything in it, including cotton buds. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 441.87,
      "end_seconds": 443.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 444.54,
      "end_seconds": 455.81,
      "duration_seconds": 11.27,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you get discharge, swelling behind the ear or the pain gets much worse. Let's review you in ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 457.01,
      "end_seconds": 460.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I'll book your follow-up at the front desk on your way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 462.16,
      "end_seconds": 465.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 465.74,
      "end_seconds": 468.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "I appreciate your time, doctor."
    }
  ]
}